{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f160431bafd72e2d415a","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"이상한 웃음소리와 함께, 한 약충이 그림자 속에서 모습을 드러냈다","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["2749949974211973652"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a57352c41c0ad9099354","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"오너라, 용사여. 어둠을 관장하는 징징 대마왕인 나를 알현하라!","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11750400148394879359"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b339bf9922facee68695","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"큭큭큭… 아니지. 징징징——예언의 사자가 마침내 이곳에 당도한 것인가?","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17596098401769615326"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f995371b27db83f1c50a","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"그렇다면 내 질문에 답하거라——불타는 태양이 꺼진 곳, 한때 수많은 사람이 주목하던 대회장에 아직도 타오르는 화염은 얼마나 되지?","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4415960804671873277"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-0e295be26f0f15f07c3d","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"5개","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["13962757223903008869","9236604193786477359"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-d6dc98f946bb0ba10eb5","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"틀렸다!——정답은 영광의 좌대에 있다, 징","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13235614436731884637","1582035152165906253"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f28c85a82b48dd94a2cb","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"세심하지 못한 사람은 벌을 받아야지. 크렘노스 전사 칭호를 반납하고, 신병부터 다시 수련하라, 징!","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15194592633957313788","4508673810180237315"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f1be24a5d89e4faeeaa6","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"수련을 마치고 돌아왔는가? 그렇다면 내 질문에 답하거라——불타는 태양이 꺼진 곳, 한때 수많은 사람이 주목하던 대회장에 아직도 타오르는 화염은 얼마나 되지?","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12804383444173441233"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-8840c8f73513aa564527","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"9개","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14980182164121229040","12591467704347106654"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-2fc1ec380f6ac5ceff2f","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"틀렸다!——정답은 영광의 좌대에 있다, 징","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13235614436731884637","1582035152165906253"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b31c0b015da4223c734d","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"세심하지 못한