화염은 얼마나 되지?","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12804383444173441233"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-c7c168f387362ad962b8","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"13개","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["3265353270396824878","14474057357958246619"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b77e8db6966129483d5f","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"그래, 넌 화염의 진짜 의미를 깨달았구나…. 아, 그렇다면 화염은 얼마나 더 오래 타오를 수 있을까, 징?","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["448745830347137263","8911306124986951955"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-bca9b430dad8e8c166cc","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"넌 너의 힘을 증명했다——어떤 약충도 너와 견줄 수 없으니 길을 비켜주겠다","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9085292749920518508","17139050325362348568"],"speakerHashCandidates":["17950901650603226953"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-ebebfb84f985fc96e1cd","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"전부 꺼졌어","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["756100853531118269","1886526074224677694"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b1c2a8d0fbe1b5514e54","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s86b63d65b1cfb19a","text":"틀렸다!——정답은 영광의 좌대에 있다, 징","speaker":"여명의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 82","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13235614436731884637","1582035152165906253"],"speakerHashCandidates":["179509016506